        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721180/extras/eeb0c8ff1b411f1f34ae64a11b0fc11b.avif?t=1788700199\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721180/extras_big/eeb0c8ff1b411f1f34ae64a11b0fc11b.webp?t=1788700199 width=1560 height=499 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helene Marilyn </strong>the pop-star becomes your dress-up doll in this  <strong>FREE</strong> Dress-up game, inspired by similar browser games of the early 2000's!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cute and girly-pop vibes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>450</strong> different articles of clothing and accessories to mix and match!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of color-variant for clothes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change backgrounds, add stickers, makeup, and change hair colors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover fun and secret interactions with both Helene and Hampt!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the <strong>HAMPT RUN</strong> mini game and unlock even more clothes for Helene to wear!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View featured <strong>art,</strong> and read the first 5 issues of the comic series<strong>: Misadventures of Helene &amp; Hampt,</strong> in the Gallery!<br>    </p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721180/extras/eeb0c8ff1b411f1f34ae64a11b0fc11b.avif?t=1788700199\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3721180/extras_big/eeb0c8ff1b411f1f34ae64a11b0fc11b.webp?t=1788700199 width=1560 height=499 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Helene Marilyn </strong>the pop-star becomes your dress-up doll in this  <strong>FREE</strong> Dress-up game, inspired by similar browser games of the early 2000's!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cute and girly-pop vibes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>450</strong> different articles of clothing and accessories to mix and match!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of color-variant for clothes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change backgrounds, add stickers, makeup, and change hair colors!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Discover fun and secret interactions with both Helene and Hampt!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the <strong>HAMPT RUN</strong> mini game and unlock even more clothes for Helene to wear!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >View featured <strong>art,</strong> and read the first 5 issues of the comic series<strong>: Misadventures of Helene &amp; Hampt,</strong> in the Gallery!<br>    </p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Helene Marilyn becomes your dress-up doll in this cute little Dress-up game! Mix and match with over 450 different articles of clothing and accessories!",
